# SDD Workflow Rules

## Before Writing Code
1. Check if a spec exists for this feature in `specs/NNN-feature/`
2. Read `spec.md` for requirements and acceptance criteria
3. Read `tasks.md` for the specific task you're implementing
4. Reference the task ID in your commit message

## Task Mapping
- Every code change MUST map to a task in `specs/NNN-feature/tasks.md`
- Mark tasks as `[x]` when complete
- Do not implement features that have no spec

## Validation
- After implementation, follow `quickstart.md` to verify
- Run `pytest tests/` to ensure nothing is broken
- Update the manifest if outputs are generated

## Commit Convention
```
feat(NNN): T0XX — brief description

Implements task T0XX from specs/NNN-feature/tasks.md
```
